rule decision12_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision12:
the decision12 is a number N if
    N = 10 / 5.

rule decision13_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision13:
the decision13 is a number N if
    N = -10 / -5.

rule decision14_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision14:
the decision14 is a number N if
