rule decision15_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision15:
the decision15 is a number N if
    N = 30 / -15.

rule decision16_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision16:
the decision16 is a number N if
    N = 30 / 0.

rule decision17_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision17:
the decision17 is a number if
    the power of 10 to 5 is the number.

rule decision18_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision18:
the decision18 is a number if
    the power of 10 to -5 is the number.

rule decision19_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision19:
the decision19 is a number if
    the power of 7 to 5 is the number.

rule decision20_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision20:
the decision20 is a number N if
    the power of 2 to 5 is a result R
    and N = 5 + R.

rule decision21_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision21:
the decision21 is a number N if
    the power of 2 to 5 is a result R
    and N = 5 + R + 3.

rule decision22_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision22:
the decision22 is a number N if
    the power of 2 to 8 is a result R
    and N = 5 + R.

rule decision31_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision31:
the decision31 is a number N if
    N = 10 + 20 / -5 - 3.

rule decision32_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision32:
the decision32 is a number N if
    N = 10 + 20 / -8.

rule decision33_1 with provenance the model at decision Decision33:
the decision33 is a number N if
    the power of 10 to 3 is a result R
    and N = 1.2 * R.

